mapping "V5594.1" source="V5594" target="242090001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5594 = Swedish activity-context subdivision of ICD-10 V55.9 (Occupant of pick-up
        truck/van, unspecified occupant, injured in traffic collision with railway train; activity =
        vital activity such as rest/sleep/meals/personal hygiene). Activity suffix is
        Swedish-administrative with no SNOMED CT analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4054296 — base V55.9 crosswalk
        target; fully covers the crash scenario. 444074 = Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident —
        broader context also in the crosswalk. Both broader: targets subsume the crash scenario, drop
        the Swedish-only activity dimension. Moderate tier: verified base-level Athena crosswalk,
        mechanical extension to Swedish subcode, not independently re-verified.
        """
}
